{"id":"463608296","kind":"article","title":"助记媒介卡片穿插在阅读过程中","author":"Andy Matuschak","original_authors":["Andy Matuschak"],"original_source_urls":["https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zE1sr3TTDoEJut4hgai2w6qFUwBYHSkk7no"],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"助记媒介 & 思想工具","date":"2022-02-02","updated":"2026-10-27","votes":6,"comment_count":2,"minutes":1,"chars":657,"keywords":["助记媒介","间隔重复","阅读理解","检索练习","学习设计"],"summary":"作者建议把助记媒介卡片直接穿插在文章阅读过程中，而非单独提供一组卡片或等读完后再测。作者预期这种细粒度嵌入可能让读者读得更慢、更专心，提示重点并自然中断阅读，也让读者更容易管理自己收集的卡片；设计依赖提示轻量，卡片间隔仍待探索。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/463608296","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"链接至本文（已汉化）"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"声明"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"dwzu4A-j\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z8ASeF682pSQ3feo8LHpLzk3u3SNpVUgNxMAU\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">助记媒介提供专家编写的卡片以消除制卡负担</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>中描述的想法的 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z4erShe1C2qB39z4r8yDox1FuM2ZhRJxxTXbN\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Quizlet</a> 式实现，把提供的卡片与文本本身分开了。例如，你也许会在读了一篇文章几天后才被问及它的内容。或是在文章的结尾提供卡片，使你读完文章之后才会看到。我们对<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z4rRX3qwSSJRsEkdXKwH2shamgHNeRthrMLiF\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">助记媒介</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>的设计与这些方法不同，它将卡片穿插在阅读过程中，颗粒度更细。</p><p data-pid=\"mDRNBTAV\">一些（潜在的、预期的、观察到的）后果：</p><ul><li data-pid=\"OvAOaOuW\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z7W1Zr7wEGptA3bFYwwaPbCFLBo54xXmQLQdK\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">助记媒介可能会促使读者更缓慢、更专心地阅读</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup><br/> <br/></li><li data-pid=\"EXG6vvUm\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zA6tshJmivafEMKvd4BKx7CaxP252KVj65B\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">助记媒介的卡片提示了作者认为重要的内容</a><br/><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"SMtXX_in\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z2TCHSDXHpLAH7137LZ5zZjcRVepwtrMVLpk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">材料中嵌入助记媒介卡片能带来安全感</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup><br/><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"wOCPbqeK\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z4sXBJLQQrFYFUKPE9nrW5gDndYWCPP7Kic\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">助记媒介复习集使阅读过程产生了自然的中断</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-5\"><a href=\"#ref-5\">[5]</a></sup><br/><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"9ZGPZt5x\"> 为<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z3XqmAYKcD411jZgBik9oyXgcrarXycADWVeh\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">助记媒介应该让读者对他们收集的卡片进行控制</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-6\"><a href=\"#ref-6\">[6]</a></sup><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-7\"><a href=\"#ref-7\">[7]</a></sup>提供了更自然的机会<br/><br/> </li></ul><p data-pid=\"B4Uvr0ec\">这个设计决定依赖于：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z7U6zXNGgTz1aEpRDUe6eMxotrhK4tmgprcxh\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">助记媒介依赖的卡片应是轻量级的</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-8\"><a href=\"#ref-8\">[8]</a></sup>。</p><p data-pid=\"tqxbQ1_j\">一些问题：</p><ul><li data-pid=\"cUMqkpkV\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z2HvBwx8Uqr7ErLp28oTuiKebTYy3RaRgv4B7\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">如何给助记媒介的复习集安排间隔？</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-1\">链接至本文（已汉化）</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"AdqmtkJL\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"459483765\" href=\"#/post/459483765\">助记媒介 (Mnemonic medium)</a></li><li data-pid=\"OSdc05TB\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"415037723\" href=\"#/post/415037723\">助记媒介提供专家编写的卡片来消除编写卡片的负担</a></li><li data-pid=\"xGa-4hKT\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"469542171\" href=\"#/post/469542171\">助记媒介依赖的卡片应是轻量级的</a></li><li data-pid=\"RMikaaDr\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"478084993\" href=\"#/post/478084993\">助记媒介可能会促使读者更缓慢、更专心地阅读</a></li><li data-pid=\"D0tfLUro\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"542688360\" href=\"#/post/542688360\">助记媒介的复习集使阅读过程产生了自然的中断</a></li><li data-pid=\"JcM3lWVi\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"677785901\" href=\"#/post/677785901\">附加问题</a></li><li data-pid=\"0wQDhEIX\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"678195187\" href=\"#/post/678195187\">阅读理解问题令人不快</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-2\">声明</h2><p data-pid=\"EXe-X8pe\">此内容发布由 Andy Matuschak 许可。未经允许，不得转载或修改。保留所有权利。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"cgnhr8yM\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zE1sr3TTDoEJut4hgai2w6qFUwBYHSkk7no\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Mnemonic medium prompts are interleaved into the reading experience (andymatuschak.org)</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 助记媒介提供专家编写的卡片来消除编写卡片的负担 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"415037723\" href=\"#/post/415037723\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 助记媒介 (Mnemonic medium) <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"459483765\" href=\"#/post/459483765\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 助记媒介可能会促使读者更缓慢、更专心地阅读 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"478084993\" href=\"#/post/478084993\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-4\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-4\">↩</a> 材料中嵌入助记媒介卡片能带来安全感 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"537188042\" href=\"#/post/537188042\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-5\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-5\">↩</a> 助记媒介的复习集使阅读过程产生了自然的中断 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"542688360\" href=\"#/post/542688360\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-6\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-6\">↩</a> 助记媒介应该允许读者对他们收集的卡片进行控制 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"459483765\" href=\"#/post/459483765\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-7\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-7\">↩</a> 助记媒介应该允许读者对他们收集的卡片进行控制 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"481230325\" href=\"#/post/481230325\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-8\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-8\">↩</a> https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/469542171 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"469542171\" href=\"#/post/469542171\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"459483765","title":"助记媒介（Mnemonic medium）","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":37,"minutes":6,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 助记媒介 & 思想工具"},{"id":"463811042","title":"创制环境极大程度受作者的动机塑造","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":13,"minutes":2,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 助记媒介 & 思想工具"},{"id":"469542171","title":"助记媒介依赖的卡片应是轻量级的","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":15,"minutes":3,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"478084993","title":"助记媒介可能会促使读者更缓慢、更专心地阅读","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":10,"minutes":2,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"481230325","title":"助记媒介应该允许读者对他们收集的卡片进行控制","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":9,"minutes":5,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[],"rec_answers":[]}